The review extension files were freshly generated by `checks/independent_extensions.py` from the supplied adversarial review. That program completed 22 ring/dimension campaigns. The separate `additional_boundaries.py` was not rerun and none of its old outputs are included as fresh.

Source programs themselves remain in the three user-provided archives identified by SHA-256 in `data/input_archives.json`. The independent delivered code runs without those archives. No Paper B PDF is redistributed; its full parsed mathematical text was read from the Library.
